Story: First cup
  As a tea drinker
  I want to start the kettle by turning the dial
  So that it works like the one I already have

  Scenario: Turn it up, then turn it off
    When the dial is 80 %
    Then the kettle is heating
    When the dial is 0 %
    And the user presses reset
    Then the kettle is off

Story: Keeping little hands off
  As a parent
  I want the child lock to keep the kettle off
  So that a curious toddler turning the dial doesn't start it

  Scenario: Turn the dial with the lock on, then unlock and boil
    When the user presses lock
    Then the child lock is on
    When the dial is 100 %
    Then the kettle is off
    When the dial is 0 %
    And the user presses lock
    Then the child lock is off
    When the dial is 80 %
    Then the kettle is heating

Story: Choosing a preset
  As someone who drinks green tea
  I want to pick how hot the water gets before I start
  So that I don't scald the leaves

  Scenario: Step to HOT and start
    When the user presses preset
    Then the preset is HOT
    When the user presses start
    Then the kettle is heating
